#
#	USBMIDI9 OMS driver CodeWarrior linker export list.
#
#	Exported symbols of the OMS driver PEF container. The 'PPCC' 1
#	code resource is this fragment's raw PEF container (the
#	authenticated native-PPC carrier: OMS 2.3.8 loads
#	Get1Resource('PPCC', xxportNumB) and loads the fragment via
#	GetDiskFragment; see oms/ppcc.r + docs/g4-handoff.md).
#	`main` is the OMS driver entry point: OMSCALLBACK(long)
#	main(short msg, long par1, long par2) (OMSDriver.h).
#
main
